[cases] id | ordinal | primary_declaration_id | smell | verdict | suppressed | start_line | end_line | why | diagnosis
"C-3d6d2adfd3" | 2 | 5 | "high-cognitive-complexity" | "FAIL" | 0 | 27 | 37 | "Deep or repeated decision structures make behavior harder to follow." | "fixture.Complex exceeds the configured cognitive-complexity limit; its decision structure may need simplification."
"C-4063b2b57c" | 5 | 1 | "feature-envy" | "FAIL" | 0 | 44 | 46 | "Concentrated access to another value can indicate misplaced behavior." | "fixture.(Own).Envy meets the configured foreign-access and ratio conditions; behavior may belong nearer a qualifying foreign value. Zero own accesses satisfies the ratio condition once the foreign minimum is met."
"C-47c5c497d6" | 6 | 2 | "data-clump" | "FAIL" | 0 | 47 | 47 | "Repeated groups of parameter types can indicate a missing shared concept." | "The parameter multiset anchored at fixture.ClumpA recurs at the configured support and size; it may represent a missing domain object."
"C-4fb5041cb7" | 3 | 6 | "excessive-dependencies" | "FAIL" | 0 | 38 | 39 | "A broad dependency set is a lead to inspect where knowledge and decisions belong; the count alone does not establish mixed responsibilities." | "fixture.Dependencies exceeds the configured dependency limit. Inspect its evidence for repeated policy, exposed implementation details, implicit contracts, and cohesive collaboration."
"C-5522b4859c" | 7 | 9 | "cosmetic-extraction" | "FAIL" | 0 | 50 | 53 | "Single-use helper sequences can retain the original procedure's coupling while hiding its metrics." | "fixture.Parent has helper clusters meeting the configured overlap conditions, and candidate expansion exceeds a configured metric limit; this may be cosmetic decomposition even if the helper names sound meaningful."
"C-ad03ea5957" | 1 | 8 | "long-parameter-list" | "FAIL" | 0 | 26 | 26 | "Many parameters can obscure which inputs belong together." | "fixture.Parameters exceeds the configured parameter limit; its inputs may represent a missing domain concept or mixed responsibilities."
"C-b10bccb46b" | 0 | 7 | "long-function" | "FAIL" | 0 | 13 | 25 | "Long functions can obscure responsibility boundaries and ownership." | "fixture.LongFunction exceeds the configured source-line limit; this may indicate responsibilities that deserve separate boundaries."
"C-cf8ec1ee12" | 4 | 6 | "long-parameter-list" | "FAIL" | 0 | 38 | 39 | "Many parameters can obscure which inputs belong together." | "fixture.Dependencies exceeds the configured parameter limit; its inputs may represent a missing domain concept or mixed responsibilities."

